    description: "Found by the 2026-11-07 docstring staleness audit (dev 4f2feb451b): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_11072026/review, verify and blind). Corpus impact not measured. Step 3 emits uses with is_resolved=True, derived_from=[edge.id, type_class_id] (inherited_calls.py:1396-1406); the linker has supersedes_consumed_stub=True (:954); finalize._demote_stubs_named_as_consumed (:492-532) never checks edge type. Java OwnerRepository extends JpaRepository, repo.save(o): the stub to java:external:...:save comes out rank_score 0.25 with superseded_by the uses edge. WI-jomik measured 620 such edges on jedis. r18, v07."  # a889
