  message: "Fixed in PR #2095. inherited_calls.py Site-2 step 3 (type use, call left unresolved) names the caller, not the call stub, in derived_from; steps 1 and 2, which resolve the call, still name the stub. Live repro, same Java repo on dev and branch (OwnerRepository extends CrudRepository; OwnerController calls owners.save(...) and repo.save(...)): dev -> both save stubs rank_score 0.25 with meta.superseded_by the uses edge (origin inherited-calls-linker); branch -> both stubs rank_score 0.5, no superseded_by, uses edges derived_from [caller, OwnerRepository]. Test: TestSite2TypeUseDoesNotSupersedeTheCall runs finalize.demote_superseded_stubs."  # ffbf
